+/* Copyright 2011-2013 Google Inc.
+ * Copyright 2013 mike wakerly <opensource@hoho.com>
+ * Copyright 2020 kai morich <mail@kai-morich.de>
+ *
+ * Project home page: https://github.com/mik3y/usb-serial-for-android
